An '''Aroma Lady''' (Japanese: '''アロマなおねえさん''' ''Aroma Lady'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that debuted in the [[Generation III]] games. They are generally depicted as young women surrounded by swirling flower petals.

They tend to specialize in {{type|Grass}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}, especially {{p|Roselia}} and its evolutionary relatives, as well as other Pokémon known for their smells. Their introductions often mention scents or aromas.

