==In the manga==
===Pokémon Adventures===
===={{MangaArc|Emerald}}====
In ''[[PS319|Verily Vanquishing Vileplume I]]'', Aroma Lady Rose (Japanese: '''ヤヨイ''' ''Yayoi'') was one of the Trainers that traveled to the {{gdis|Battle Frontier|III}} to participate in the [[Battle Dome]] tournament. In the fifth battle of the first round, she faced {{adv|Emerald}} but was defeated.

===={{MangaArc|Diamond & Pearl}}====
In ''[[PS361|Bombastic Bibarel & Heroic Hippopotas]]'', an Aroma Lady appeared at the [[Seven Stars Restaurant]].

===={{MangaArc|Platinum}}====
An Aroma Lady appeared as a background character in ''[[PS418|Deprogramming Porygon-Z]]'', where she was part of a group of people who entered the {{gdis|Battle Frontier|IV}} after [[Palmer]] had his assistants open the gates. Another Aroma Lady was seen amongst the people waiting in line for the [[Battle Castle]].

===={{MangaArc|Black 2 & White 2}}====
{{adv|Maya}}, a student at the [[Aspertia City]] [[Pokémon academy|Trainers' School]], is based on the Aroma Lady Trainer class from {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}.

