==In the TCG==
[[File:AromaLadyEvolvingSkies199.jpg|200px|thumb|Full Art print of Aroma Lady]]
{{main|Aroma Lady (Evolving Skies 141)}}
'''Aroma Lady''' was introduced as a {{TCG|Supporter card}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] during the English Sword & Shield Series (the Japanese Sword & Shield Era). It was first released in the Japanese {{TCG|Eevee Heroes}} subset before debuting in English in the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion, with artwork by [[Megumi Mizutani]]. It was also released as a {{TCG|Full Art card}} and {{TCG|Secret card}} in the same Japanese and English expansions, with artwork by [[En Morikura]]. It allows the player to attach draw two cards, then heal their Active Pokémon's {{TCG|Special Condition}}s.
